  baseline = replicate (22-item batch, matches anchored)
    [pre-declared exclusions] DiD(z) = +1.0069  95% CI [+0.5788, +1.4114]  excludes 0  up 9/10
      placebo mean signal(z) = +0.0289   (should be ~0 if anchoring per se does not inflate)
    [all 12 reverse items] DiD(z) = +0.8499  95% CI [+0.4562, +1.2441]  excludes 0  up 10/12
